WEBVTT

00:02.377 --> 00:03.169
French Narrator:
Patchy the Pirate presents:
法语旁白：
海盗帕奇呈现：

00:03.253 --> 00:04.379
Ahoy.
哎呀。

00:04.462 --> 00:05.922
It's a "SpongeBob SquarePants"
special.
这是“海绵宝宝”
特别的。

00:10.719 --> 00:13.972
Captioning Provided By:
MTV Networks
字幕提供者：
MTV网络

00:14.055 --> 00:15.432
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:15.515 --> 00:17.142
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:17.225 --> 00:18.893
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：
是的，是的，船长。

00:18.977 --> 00:21.771
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:21.855 --> 00:23.815
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:23.898 --> 00:26.025
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:26.109 --> 00:27.736
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:27.819 --> 00:29.904
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:29.988 --> 00:31.865
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:31.948 --> 00:33.825
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.908 --> 00:35.744
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:35.827 --> 00:37.203
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:37.287 --> 00:38.455
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:38.538 --> 00:39.706
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:39.789 --> 00:41.958
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:42.041 --> 00:43.877
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:43.960 --> 00:47.297
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

01:09.569 --> 01:11.154
SpongeBob: Backing up.
海绵宝宝：后退。

01:11.237 --> 01:12.447
:
Boop, boop, boop, boop
：
噗，噗，噗，噗

01:12.530 --> 01:14.532
boop, boop, boop...
噗，噗，噗……

01:14.616 --> 01:16.493
You're better off
not knowing.
你过得更好
不知道。

01:16.576 --> 01:18.411
SpongeBob: Boop,
boop, boop...
海绵宝宝：噗，
噗，噗……

01:18.495 --> 01:20.580
Your Krabby Patty, sir.
你的蟹肉饼，先生。

01:20.663 --> 01:23.124
Do you always serve
your food this way?
你总是服务吗
你的食物是这样的吗？

01:23.208 --> 01:24.667
You mean with a smile?
你是说带着微笑吗？

01:24.751 --> 01:25.418
Yes, sir.
是的，先生。

01:25.502 --> 01:27.003
Beware.
提防。

01:27.086 --> 01:29.380
Let it be known
to all far and wide
让大家知道
致所有远方

01:29.464 --> 01:30.757
the mollusks are coming.
软体动物来了。

01:30.840 --> 01:33.259
Tally-ho,
the mollusks are coming.
塔利浩，
软体动物来了。

01:33.343 --> 01:35.094
The mollusks are coming.
软体动物来了。

01:35.178 --> 01:37.514
The mollusks are coming.
软体动物来了。

01:37.597 --> 01:40.892
The mollusks are coming!
软体动物来了！

01:40.975 --> 01:43.019
Not the mollusks!
不是软体动物！

01:43.102 --> 01:44.979
Mollusks?
What mollusks?
软体动物？
什么软体动物？

01:45.063 --> 01:48.316
There aren't any mollusks
coming, are there, Patrick?
没有任何软体动物
来了，在吗，帕特里克？

01:48.399 --> 01:49.943
No.
不。

01:50.026 --> 01:53.446
I was only pretending
to be my famous Great-Great
我只是假装
成为我著名的伟人

01:53.530 --> 01:55.365
Great Uncle Patrick Revere.
曾祖父帕特里克·里维尔。

01:55.448 --> 01:56.950
He rode through the streets
他骑着马穿过街道

01:57.033 --> 01:59.744
warning Bikini Bottom
of the coming hordes
警告 比基尼泳裤
即将到来的部落

01:59.828 --> 02:03.414
of ravenous man-eating mollusks.
贪婪的食人软体动物。

02:03.498 --> 02:05.500
Patrick Revere:
The mollusks are coming.
帕特里克·里维尔：
软体动物来了。

02:05.583 --> 02:07.502
The mollusks are coming.
软体动物来了。

02:07.585 --> 02:09.546
Patrick: It's too bad nobody
listened to him.
帕特里克：可惜没有人
听他说。

02:09.629 --> 02:13.132
What be-ith the deal
with ye old nut case?
这笔交易是什么
带着旧坚果盒吗？

02:17.470 --> 02:20.557
Wow, Patrick, I didn't know
you had a famous relative?
哇，帕特里克，我不知道
你有一个著名的亲戚吗？

02:20.640 --> 02:22.600
Well, the best
part about it is
嗯，最好的
关于它的部分是

02:22.684 --> 02:25.520
I don't have to
accomplish anything in life
我不必
完成生活中的任何事情

02:25.603 --> 02:28.565
because my uncle
already did it for me.
因为我叔叔
已经为我做了。

02:28.648 --> 02:30.024
Really takes
the old pressure off.
确实需要
老压断。

02:30.108 --> 02:31.317
That's nothing.
那没什么。

02:31.401 --> 02:33.069
My Great-Great-Grandpappy Krabs
我的曾曾祖父蟹蟹

02:33.152 --> 02:35.446
invented the greatest
thing since loose change:
发明了最伟大的
自零钱以来的事情：

02:35.530 --> 02:37.907
the Spendthrift Billfold System.
Spendthrift Billfold系统。

02:37.991 --> 02:39.325
Allow me to demonstrate.
请允许我演示一下。

02:39.409 --> 02:41.286
Hey, SpongeBob,
how 'bout a raise?
嘿，海绵宝宝，
加薪怎么样？

02:41.369 --> 02:43.162
Gee, thanks, Mr. Krabs.
哎呀，谢谢蟹老板。

02:43.246 --> 02:45.874
Uh-uh-uh... Watch.
呃呃呃……看。

02:47.041 --> 02:48.042
Ah! See?
啊!看？

02:48.126 --> 02:49.836
Doesn't that hurt?
不疼吗？

02:49.919 --> 02:51.087
Every time.
每次。

02:52.422 --> 02:55.300
Gosh, I don't have
anyone famous in  my  family.
天哪，我没有
我家族中的任何名人。

02:55.383 --> 02:59.679
Oh, well, then it's lucky
you have me as a famous friend
呵呵，那就幸运了
我是你的著名朋友

02:59.762 --> 03:02.473
or your life would
be a hollow shell.
或者你的生活会
是一个空心的壳。

03:05.768 --> 03:09.022
I'll bet your somebody's famous
poop-covered ancestor.
我敢打赌你的某个人很有名
被粪便覆盖的祖先。

03:11.232 --> 03:14.611
I never realized how sad
and empty my life was
我从来没有意识到有多悲伤
我的生活空虚

03:14.694 --> 03:17.363
until my friends pointed it out.
直到我的朋友指出。

03:17.447 --> 03:18.948
Hi-yah!
嗨呀！

03:19.032 --> 03:20.199
Hi, Sandy.
嗨，桑迪。

03:21.743 --> 03:23.202
Something wrong, SpongeBob?
有什么问题吗，海绵宝宝？

03:23.286 --> 03:25.997
You look sadder than
a bull frog full of soda-pop.
你看起来比
一只装满汽水的牛蛙

03:26.080 --> 03:28.249
Do you have any famous
relatives, Sandy?
你有什么著名的
亲戚，桑迪？

03:28.333 --> 03:29.417
I sure do.
我当然知道。

03:29.500 --> 03:30.877
My Great-Aunt Rosy Cheeks
我的姑婆红润的脸颊

03:30.960 --> 03:32.545
was the first squirrel
to discover oil
是第一只松鼠
发现石油

03:32.629 --> 03:34.380
at Spindletop, Texas.
位于德克萨斯州斯宾德尔托普。

03:34.464 --> 03:36.090
Man: She's ready to blow!
男人：她已经准备好爆炸了！

03:40.887 --> 03:43.973
Seems like everybody in town
has a famous relative.
看来城里的每个人
有一个著名的亲戚。

03:44.057 --> 03:45.808
Everybody except me.
除了我之外的所有人。

03:45.892 --> 03:48.895
Come on, I bet y'all got someone
famous in your family tree.
来吧，我打赌你们都有人了
在你的家谱中很有名。

03:48.978 --> 03:50.730
Well, there was my Uncle Sherm.
嗯，还有我的谢姆叔叔。

03:50.813 --> 03:52.649
He could stick an entire
watermelon up his nose.
他可以贴一整个
西瓜进了鼻子。

03:52.732 --> 03:55.151
That's not the
kind of famous I mean.
那不是
我的意思是有点出名。

03:55.234 --> 03:57.654
Come on, let's do a little
digging around your family tree.
来吧，我们做一点
挖掘你的家谱。

04:00.114 --> 04:02.742
Sandy: "Family Histories
of Bikini Bottom."
桑迪：“家族史
比基尼泳裤。”

04:02.825 --> 04:05.662
Let's see, SquareHead,
SquareShirt, SquarePants...
让我们看看，方头，
方衫、方裤……

04:05.745 --> 04:07.330
Hey, look it here...
嘿，看这里...

04:07.413 --> 04:10.917
: It's a statue of
SpongeBuck SquarePants.
: 这是一座雕像
海绵巴克方裤。

04:11.000 --> 04:13.127
SpongeBob: I've never
even heard of him.
海绵宝宝：我从来没有
甚至听说过他。

04:13.211 --> 04:14.921
He got his own statute?
他有自己的法令吗？

04:15.004 --> 04:18.591
Says here, he saved the entire
town of Dead Eye Gulch.
说到这里，他拯救了整个
死眼峡谷小镇。

04:18.675 --> 04:22.011
Sandy: That's what
Bikini Bottom was known as
back in the Old West days.
桑迪：就是这样
比基尼泳裤被称为
回到旧西部时代。

04:24.013 --> 04:27.767
...it was a town
that lived under the tyranny
of a nasty crook
……那是一个城镇
生活在暴政之下
一个可恶的骗子

04:27.850 --> 04:31.604
till a mysterious stranger
came to town.
直到一个神秘的陌生人
来到城里。

04:33.523 --> 04:35.942
Wow... The big city.
哇……大城市。

04:36.025 --> 04:39.153
Well, time to make my fortune.
好吧，是时候发财了。

04:39.237 --> 04:40.905
Sandy: Back in them days
桑迪：回到过去

04:40.989 --> 04:44.367
the whole place was run by that
no-good galoot, Dead Eye.
整个地方都是由那个管理的
坏蛋，死眼。

04:44.450 --> 04:46.494
Whew-wee!
哇哦！

04:46.577 --> 04:49.122
This place sure
is big and fancylike.
这个地方肯定
又大又奇特。

04:49.205 --> 04:51.582
Gee whillikers, they got
an ice dream parlor.
哎呀，他们得到了
冰梦室。

04:54.877 --> 04:58.506
I'll take one scoop of
"vanilli" ice cream, please.
我会拿一勺
请给我“香草”冰淇淋。

04:58.589 --> 05:00.133
You're new here,
aren't you?
你是新来的，
你不是吗？

05:00.216 --> 05:02.301
Yep, I just got
off from the train.
是的，我刚刚得到
从火车上下来。

05:02.385 --> 05:04.637
You don't say.
你不说。

05:28.911 --> 05:31.039
Business is good today.
今天生意不错。

05:34.292 --> 05:36.377
Howdy-do, y'all.
大家好。

05:36.461 --> 05:38.546
Great, another hayseed.
太好了，又一颗干草种子。

05:38.629 --> 05:40.089
Charge him double
for his drinks.
向他收取双倍费用
为了他的饮料。

05:40.173 --> 05:42.341
Howdy, partners.
你好，伙伴们。

05:42.425 --> 05:44.844
Pardon, but is
this stool taken?
抱歉，但是是
这个凳子拿了吗？

05:44.927 --> 05:49.015
Yeah, some fancy dude
just sat in it.
是啊，有位帅气的家伙
就坐在里面。

05:49.098 --> 05:50.641
What can I get you,
stranger?
我能给你什么
陌生人？

05:50.725 --> 05:53.895
Give me a shot... Of milk.
给我一杯……牛奶。

05:53.978 --> 05:56.773
Milk?
牛奶？

05:56.856 --> 05:58.858
Think you can handle it?
你认为你能应付吗？

05:58.941 --> 06:00.902
I drink this stuff every day.
我每天都喝这个东西。

06:00.985 --> 06:02.528
Over the lips and
through the gums
在嘴唇上和
通过牙龈

06:02.612 --> 06:05.531
look out tapeworm here it comes.
小心绦虫来了。

06:05.615 --> 06:06.532
Get ready, "tapey."
准备好，“胶带”。

06:12.955 --> 06:13.664
Ah!
啊!

06:16.626 --> 06:18.336
Oh, yeah...
哦，是的...

06:18.419 --> 06:20.046
Smooth.
光滑的。

06:20.129 --> 06:22.632
What brings you to
Dead Eye Gulch, stranger?
是什么让你来到
死眼峡谷，陌生人？

06:22.715 --> 06:24.217
Strange is right.
奇怪是对的。

06:24.300 --> 06:25.968
The name's SpongeBuck.
名字叫海绵巴克。

06:26.052 --> 06:28.554
I left home to make
my way here in the big city.
我离开家去制作
我在大城市的路。

06:28.638 --> 06:30.264
I'm here for the job.
我是来找工作的

06:30.348 --> 06:31.766
Wonderful, you're hired.
太棒了，你被录用了。

06:31.849 --> 06:32.934
Hey, everybody...
嘿，大家...

06:33.017 --> 06:34.519
Meet our new sheriff.
认识我们的新警长。

06:36.854 --> 06:39.232
Sheriff?
I'm not here for
the sheriff job.
警长？
我来这里不是为了
警长的工作。

06:39.315 --> 06:41.359
I'm here for the fry cook job.
我来这里是为了炒菜厨师的工作。

06:41.442 --> 06:42.944
Back home, I'm known for my
回到家后，我因我的

06:43.027 --> 06:45.696
rootin', tootin',
never puttin' chili...
扎根，嘟嘟，
从来不放辣椒...

06:45.780 --> 06:49.784
...the spiciest chili
west of the old red barn.
...最辣的辣椒
老红谷仓西边。

06:49.867 --> 06:51.410
Yech!
耶！

06:51.494 --> 06:53.579
No offense, kid, but your
chili tastes terrible.
无意冒犯，孩子，但是你的
辣椒味道很糟糕。

06:53.663 --> 06:54.831
In a good way?
以一种好的方式？

06:54.914 --> 06:57.083
No, in a terrible way.
不，以一种可怕的方式。

06:57.166 --> 06:59.001
Look, we already gave
you the badge.
看，我们已经给了
你这个徽章。

06:59.085 --> 07:01.420
And the law of the West says,
"No takebacks."
西方法律规定，
“没有收回。”

07:01.504 --> 07:03.256
Since when?
从什么时候开始？

07:03.339 --> 07:04.841
Since...
自从...

07:04.924 --> 07:07.135
So that means,
you're the new sheriff.
所以这意味着，
你是新任警长。

07:07.218 --> 07:08.594
What happened
to the old sheriff?
发生了什么
老警长？

07:08.678 --> 07:09.679
Krabs: Uh, he's at Boot Hill.
Krabs：呃，他在 Boot Hill。

07:11.472 --> 07:13.391
And why is he at Boot Hill?
他为什么在布特山？

07:13.474 --> 07:17.061
Krabs: Because Old Dead Tree
Hill was totally full.
螃蟹：因为老死树
希尔完全满了。

07:17.145 --> 07:20.398
He's a-coming...
Dead Eye's a-coming.
他来了...
死眼即将来临。

07:20.481 --> 07:21.357
All: Dead Eye!
全体：死眼！

07:21.440 --> 07:22.608
Dead Eye?
死眼？

07:22.692 --> 07:23.943
Who's Dead Eye?
死眼是谁？

07:24.026 --> 07:26.279
I'll tell you
who Dead Eye is.
我告诉你
死眼是谁。

07:26.362 --> 07:27.697
But I shall do it...
但我会这么做...

07:27.780 --> 07:28.865
through song.
通过歌曲。

07:30.533 --> 07:31.409
Maestro, if you please.
大师，如果你愿意的话。

07:41.627 --> 07:44.463
♪ Oh, Bikini Gulch
was a pretty place ♪
♪ 哦，比基尼峡谷
是一个美丽的地方♪

07:44.547 --> 07:47.925
♪ With sweet water
and blue sky ♪
♪ 用甜水
还有蓝天♪

07:48.009 --> 07:50.970
♪ Till one day a beast come
a-ridin' from the east ♪
♪ 直到有一天，一只野兽降临
从东方来的♪

07:51.053 --> 07:54.223
♪ By the name of old Dead Eye ♪
♪ 以老死眼之名 ♪

07:54.307 --> 07:57.268
♪ That dirty old
good Dead Eye ♪
♪ 那个脏旧的
好死眼♪

07:57.351 --> 07:59.145
♪ Oh, he's robbed this town ♪
♪ 哦，他抢劫了这座城镇 ♪

07:59.228 --> 08:00.980
♪ He's pulled my pants down ♪
♪ 他把我的裤子拉下来了 ♪

08:01.063 --> 08:03.941
♪ He made all the
pretty girls cry   ♪
♪ 他创造了所有
漂亮的女孩子都哭了♪

08:04.025 --> 08:06.402
♪ That no good goon
wants my saloon ♪
♪ 这可不是好人
想要我的沙龙♪

08:06.485 --> 08:09.197
♪ And the I.O.U.'s
due tomorrow, noon ♪
♪ 还有欠条
明天中午截止♪

08:09.280 --> 08:11.282
♪ If we don't get
some help here ♪
♪ 如果我们没有得到
这里有一些帮助♪

08:11.365 --> 08:15.203
♪ Real soon... ♪
♪ 真的很快... ♪

08:15.286 --> 08:19.749
All: ♪ We're lose everything
we own to Dead Eye ♪
全体：♪我们失去了一切
我们拥有死眼♪

08:19.832 --> 08:25.922
All: ♪ We'd stop him if
we weren't too scared to try ♪
全体：♪ 我们会阻止他，如果
我们并不太害怕尝试♪

08:26.005 --> 08:27.673
Patrick: ♪ And if you
think that's funny ♪
帕特里克：♪ 如果你
觉得很有趣♪

08:27.757 --> 08:29.342
♪ Let me tell you, sonny ♪
♪ 让我告诉你，儿子 ♪

08:29.425 --> 08:31.677
♪ You won't be laughing
when you see... ♪
♪ 你不会笑的
当你看到...♪

08:33.930 --> 08:35.514
♪ His... ♪
♪ 他的... ♪

08:38.643 --> 08:39.685
♪ Big... ♪
♪ 大... ♪

08:43.397 --> 08:44.440
♪ Red... ♪
♪ 红色...♪

08:48.736 --> 08:51.405
♪ Dead Eye ♪
♪ 死眼 ♪

08:51.489 --> 08:54.533
All: ♪ Dead Eye ♪
全部：♪ 死眼 ♪

08:57.828 --> 08:59.664
That's me...
这就是我...

08:59.747 --> 09:01.332
Dead Eye Plankton.
死眼浮游生物。

09:01.415 --> 09:02.833
Who?
WHO？
WHO？
WHO？
WHO？
世界卫生组织？
世界卫生组织？
世界卫生组织？

09:02.917 --> 09:05.419
We just sang a whole
song about him.
我们刚刚唱了一整首
关于他的歌。

09:05.503 --> 09:07.338
Well, what y'all looking at?
嗯，你们都在看什么？

09:17.598 --> 09:19.100
Oh, again?
哦，又来了？

09:24.981 --> 09:27.900
Get up, you two.
起来吧，你们两个。

09:27.984 --> 09:31.570
I'm here for my...
Money, Krabs.
我来这里是为了我的...
蟹蟹们，钱啊。

09:31.654 --> 09:33.239
Heh-heh, what?
呵呵，什么？

09:33.322 --> 09:36.200
How am I supposed to keep
the deed to me saloon
我该如何保留
我的契约沙龙

09:36.284 --> 09:38.703
when you keep taking out me
mortgage payments?
当你不断地带走我时
抵押贷款付款？

09:38.786 --> 09:40.413
I'm going broke here.
我这里就要破产了。

09:40.496 --> 09:44.333
That's the idea  .
就是这个想法。

09:44.417 --> 09:46.168
I thought we were
all clear on that.
我以为我们是
一切都清楚了。

09:46.252 --> 09:47.628
Oh, yeah
哦，是的

09:47.712 --> 09:51.090
I'll be back at
high noon tomorrow
for the deed.
我会回来
明天中午
为了行为。

09:51.173 --> 09:53.926
Hey... That's
not your money.
嘿...那是
不是你的钱。

09:54.010 --> 09:57.096
Who said that?
谁说的？

09:57.179 --> 10:00.099
Well, last time I checked
嗯，上次我检查过

10:00.182 --> 10:02.268
this town was
Dead Eye Gulch.
这个小镇曾经是
死眼峡谷。

10:02.351 --> 10:05.271
Not Yokel-Burg.
不是约克尔堡。

10:07.064 --> 10:08.774
Heh-heh, heh.
呵呵，呵呵。

10:08.858 --> 10:10.901
Heh, Yokel-Burg.
呵呵，约克尔堡。

10:10.985 --> 10:12.069
Heh-heh  .
呵呵。

10:12.153 --> 10:14.655
Who are you anyway?
你到底是谁？

10:14.739 --> 10:16.449
I'm SpongeBuck,
the new sheriff.
我是海绵宝宝
新任警长。

10:16.532 --> 10:17.450
Want some chili.
要一些辣椒。

10:17.533 --> 10:19.118
Sheriff?
警长？

10:19.201 --> 10:22.288
'Round these parts,
we call 'em coffin jockeys.
'围绕这些部分，
我们称他们为棺材骑师。

10:22.371 --> 10:23.789
Coffin jockey?
棺材骑师？

10:23.873 --> 10:26.292
You didn't say
anything about that.
你没说
与此有关的任何事情。

10:26.375 --> 10:28.919
That must be a new record
for running off a sheriff.
这一定是一个新纪录
逃离警长。

10:31.130 --> 10:32.840
Hope I haven't missed
the first post.
希望我没有错过
第一篇文章。

10:32.923 --> 10:34.925
Whoa, girl.
哇，女孩。

10:36.260 --> 10:37.636
Where do you get these guys?
你从哪里得到这些家伙？

10:39.305 --> 10:41.932
All right, kid, I'm gonna
make it simple for you.
好吧，孩子，我会的
让一切变得简单。

10:42.016 --> 10:43.809
I'm a villain... Got it?
我是个恶棍……明白了吗？

10:43.893 --> 10:45.478
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

10:45.561 --> 10:48.439
And this town ain't big enough
for the both of us.
而且这个城镇还不够大
为了我们俩。

10:48.522 --> 10:49.482
Understand?
理解？

10:49.565 --> 10:50.941
Yup.
是的。

10:51.025 --> 10:52.651
So vamoose
or we're gonna have to
如此迷茫
或者我们必须

10:52.735 --> 10:55.529
settle this thing Western style
at high noon.
解决这件事西方式
正午时分。

10:55.613 --> 10:56.572
Sabe?
萨贝？

10:56.655 --> 10:58.157
Sounds great.
听起来很棒。

10:58.240 --> 10:59.825
You have no idea what I'm
talking about, do you?
你不知道我是什么
谈论的是，你呢？

10:59.909 --> 11:01.660
No...
不...

11:06.374 --> 11:07.333
He-yah!
嘿-呀！

11:07.416 --> 11:08.417
Whoa...
哇...

11:10.461 --> 11:11.420
Whoa!
哇！

11:11.504 --> 11:14.048
And stay out.
并留在外面。

11:14.131 --> 11:17.093
Hey, only three seconds
off my record.
嘿，只有三秒钟
从我的记录中删除。

11:19.303 --> 11:21.972
Dead Eye: What are you
hayseeds looking at?
死眼：你是什么
干草籽在看吗？

11:22.056 --> 11:23.849
He-yah!
嘿-呀！

11:23.933 --> 11:25.309
Dead Eye: Get...
死眼：得到……

11:25.393 --> 11:26.560
get out of here.
离开这里。

11:26.644 --> 11:28.479
What's gonna happen
to the town now, pa?
会发生什么
现在去镇上吗，爸？

11:28.562 --> 11:30.815
I ain't your pa.
我不是你爸

11:34.068 --> 11:37.947
I love this town!
我爱这个小镇！

11:44.620 --> 11:46.372
Whoa, there, whoa...
哇哦，那里，哇...

11:46.455 --> 11:47.873
Whoa!
哇！

11:47.957 --> 11:48.791
Whoa.
哇哦。

11:52.920 --> 11:55.798
Looks like the end of the trail.
看起来就像是小路的尽头。

11:55.881 --> 11:57.925
We're out of food, water...
我们没有食物、没有水……

11:58.008 --> 11:59.260
And lip balm.
还有润唇膏。

12:02.805 --> 12:04.723
I'm sorry, old paint.
对不起，旧漆。

12:04.807 --> 12:07.601
Guess I'll have to put you
out your misery.
我想我得把你
摆脱你的痛苦。

12:07.685 --> 12:09.437
So long, old friend!
再见，老朋友！

12:09.520 --> 12:11.689
Hey, buddy,
you better be careful.
嘿，伙计，
你最好小心点。

12:11.772 --> 12:14.733
The heat does funny
things to your head.
炎热确实很有趣
事情到你的头上。

12:14.817 --> 12:16.193
It does?
是吗？

12:16.277 --> 12:18.404
Oh, don't listen
to that guy, kid.
哦，别听
给那个家伙，孩子。

12:18.487 --> 12:19.905
He's looney.
他疯了。

12:23.868 --> 12:26.203
Ahh!
啊！

12:29.081 --> 12:31.375
Oh, hey, SpongeBuck.
哦，嘿，海绵巴克。

12:31.459 --> 12:33.752
Those guys are
barrel of laughs, huh?
那些家伙是
一桶笑声，是吧？

12:33.836 --> 12:35.921
But  lazy.
但很懒。

12:36.005 --> 12:39.425
Well, anyway, you gotta get back
and save the town, sheriff.
好吧，无论如何，你必须回来
拯救小镇，警长。

12:39.508 --> 12:42.344
I ain't no sheriff or fry cook
我不是警长或煎炸厨师

12:42.428 --> 12:44.430
or even coffin jockey.
甚至是棺材骑师。

12:44.513 --> 12:47.099
And I'm no match
for Dead Eye Plankton.
而我不是对手
对于死眼浮游生物。

12:47.183 --> 12:48.100
I'm nothin'.
我什么都不是

12:49.852 --> 12:52.688
Out west a man gets
right back up on his coffin
一个人向西走
就回到他的棺材上

12:52.771 --> 12:54.315
and faces his problems
with the help
并面对他的问题
在帮助下

12:54.398 --> 12:56.567
of his idiot sidekick friend.
他的白痴伙伴朋友。

12:56.650 --> 12:57.943
That's me.
这就是我。

12:58.027 --> 12:59.612
Duh...
呃……

12:59.695 --> 13:01.155
I don't know... Oh!
我不知道……哦！

13:01.238 --> 13:03.240
OK, OK, I'll do it,
just stop hurting me.
好吧好吧，我会做到的
别再伤害我了。

13:03.324 --> 13:04.909
Besides, you're right.
此外，你是对的。

13:04.992 --> 13:07.453
It's time I stepped up and
looked fate in the eye.
是时候我站出来了
命运看在眼里。

13:07.536 --> 13:10.873
So I'll go back to
Dead Eye Gulch, whip Plankton
所以我会回到
死眼峡谷，鞭打浮游生物

13:10.956 --> 13:13.584
and save the town at high noon.
并在正午拯救小镇。

13:13.667 --> 13:15.544
Hop on, buddy.
跳上来，伙计。

13:15.628 --> 13:16.962
Thanks, idiot friend.
谢谢，白痴朋友。

13:17.046 --> 13:18.297
But I don't know how
we'll ever get back
但我不知道如何
我们会回来的

13:18.380 --> 13:20.132
to Dead Eye Gulch by high noon.
正午时分到达死眼峡谷。

13:20.216 --> 13:22.301
Don't worry,
I got a shortcut.
别担心，
我有一条捷径。

13:22.384 --> 13:23.385
Hee-yaw!
嘿嘿！

13:36.065 --> 13:37.650
Why are we going so fast?
为什么我们走得这么快？

13:37.733 --> 13:39.527
'Cause without a sheriff
因为没有治安官

13:39.610 --> 13:41.487
Dead Eye won't stop till he
has the clothes off our backs.
死眼不会停止，直到他
我们把衣服脱下来了。

13:46.909 --> 13:48.994
Great idea.
好主意。

13:50.788 --> 13:52.414
Dead Eye: OK, let's see...
死眼：好吧，让我们看看……

13:52.498 --> 13:55.334
Personal possessions,
clothes off your backs?
个人财产，
衣服脱掉了吗？

13:55.417 --> 13:57.419
That should about do it.
那应该就可以了。

13:57.503 --> 14:01.840
Look, I'm just gonna go drop off
all my new stuff at the bank.
听着，我要下车了
我在银行的所有新东西。

14:01.924 --> 14:05.678
I'll be back at high noon to rub
my victory in your face
我中午回来擦
我在你面前的胜利

14:05.761 --> 14:07.846
with a little dance.
伴随着一点舞蹈。

14:07.930 --> 14:09.181
♪ Ah-ha, wha, wha ♪
♪ 啊哈，哇，哇 ♪

14:09.265 --> 14:11.517
♪ Ah-ha, wha, wha ♪
♪ 啊哈，哇，哇 ♪

14:11.600 --> 14:13.686
I gotta admit,
he's got skills.
我必须承认，
他有技能。

14:13.769 --> 14:15.354
That's right.
这是正确的。

14:15.437 --> 14:18.232
And at noon when I take
the deed to your saloon, Krabs
中午当我服用
你的酒馆契约，蟹老板

14:18.315 --> 14:21.235
I'll own every building in town.
我将拥有镇上的每一栋建筑。

14:21.318 --> 14:23.195
And you'll all have
to work for me
而你们都会拥有
为我工作

14:23.279 --> 14:25.823
the rest of your
miserable lives.
你的其余部分
悲惨的生活。

14:29.285 --> 14:31.036
: Swallowed a bug.
: 吞了一只虫子。

14:31.120 --> 14:32.371
I hate that.
我讨厌那样。

14:32.454 --> 14:35.457
It totally ruins an evil laugh.
它完全破坏了邪恶的笑声。

14:35.541 --> 14:36.333
Yee-haw!
呀呀！

14:38.711 --> 14:39.795
I guess that's it.
我想就是这样。

14:39.878 --> 14:41.463
We lost.
我们输了。

14:41.547 --> 14:43.716
I don't know how it
could get any worse.
我不知道怎么会这样
可能会变得更糟。

14:48.345 --> 14:50.681
Howdy, guys-
I'm back in the nick of time.
哈喽，伙计们——
我回来得正是时候。

14:50.764 --> 14:52.224
We're heroes.
我们是英雄。

14:52.308 --> 14:54.059
You're morons.
你们是白痴。

14:54.143 --> 14:55.227
It's too late.
太晚了。

14:55.311 --> 14:57.229
Plankton's taken everything.
浮游生物夺走了一切。

14:57.313 --> 14:59.523
But it's only 11:55.
但现在才11点55分。

14:59.607 --> 15:02.401
The final showdown always
takes place at high noon.
最后的对决总是
发生在正午。

15:02.484 --> 15:05.946
Well, I guess the early bird
gets the worm.
嗯，我猜是早起的鸟儿
得到蠕虫。

15:06.030 --> 15:07.239
And all our stuff.
还有我们所有的东西。

15:07.323 --> 15:09.116
And me money  .
还有我的钱。

15:09.199 --> 15:11.076
Me beautiful, beautiful money.
我美丽，美丽的钱。

15:11.160 --> 15:13.370
You can't give up.
你不能放弃。

15:13.454 --> 15:16.415
Before I came here,
I would have given up too.
在我来到这里之前，
我也会放弃的。

15:16.498 --> 15:19.293
But in the short
20 minutes I've known you
但短期内
20分钟我就认识你了

15:19.376 --> 15:21.587
I've come to love
Dead Eye Gulch.
我已经爱上了
死眼峡谷。

15:21.670 --> 15:23.088
Would you get to the point-
we're freezing.
你能进入正题吗——
我们冻僵了。

15:23.172 --> 15:24.381
What I'm-a sayin' is
我想说的是

15:24.465 --> 15:26.258
if we all team up together
如果我们齐心协力

15:26.342 --> 15:28.260
we can stand up
to Dead Eye Plankton
我们可以站起来
死眼浮游生物

15:28.344 --> 15:30.846
and run him right out of
Dead Eye Gulch for good.
并把他赶出
死眼峡谷永远。

15:30.929 --> 15:32.389
So what do you say?
那你说呢？

15:32.473 --> 15:34.391
Well, I think we all
know the answer.
嗯，我想我们都
知道答案。

15:34.475 --> 15:36.644
All: Forget it,
SpongeBuck.
全体：算了，
海绵巴克。

15:36.727 --> 15:38.771
What are y'all standing
in your pajamas?
你们都站什么
穿着睡衣吗？

15:38.854 --> 15:40.397
No, don't tell me.
不，别告诉我。

15:40.481 --> 15:43.275
Oh, I know, you're
throwing a slumber party.
哦，我知道，你是
举办睡衣派对。

15:43.359 --> 15:45.319
Pillow fight, oh!
枕头大战，哦！

15:47.196 --> 15:48.614
Ah!
啊!

15:48.697 --> 15:50.866
That pillow sure
packs a wallop.
那个枕头肯定
带来冲击力。

15:50.949 --> 15:52.368
It's made out of wood
它是用木头做的

15:52.451 --> 15:54.703
like all pillows
in the Old West.
像所有枕头一样
在旧西部。

15:54.787 --> 15:56.288
Round two?
第二轮？

15:56.372 --> 15:57.790
I do believe I'll
sit this one out.
我相信我会
坐这个出来。

15:57.873 --> 16:00.292
Looks like it's just
you and me, kid.
看来只是
你和我，孩子。

16:01.960 --> 16:04.296
Come on, guys,
we  can  do this
来吧，伙计们，
我们可以做到这一点

16:04.380 --> 16:06.131
if we work together.
如果我们一起工作。

16:06.215 --> 16:09.301
No offense, kid, but your advice
is as terrible as your chili.
无意冒犯，孩子，但你的建议
和你的辣椒一样可怕。

16:09.385 --> 16:11.136
I don't blame you
for losing faith.
我不怪你
因为失去信心。

16:11.220 --> 16:12.971
I lost faith, too.
我也失去了信心。

16:13.055 --> 16:16.892
But then I discovered the love
of my new idiot friend
但后来我发现了爱
我的新白痴朋友

16:16.975 --> 16:19.186
and together we've come far.
我们一起走了很远。

16:19.269 --> 16:23.482
So I'm sure with all
of us working together
in idiot friendship
所以我确信
我们一起工作
在白痴友谊中

16:23.565 --> 16:26.819
we can beat Dead Eye
and save the town.
我们可以打败死眼
并拯救小镇。

16:26.902 --> 16:29.530
So let's huddle up
and make a plan... Together.
所以让我们挤在一起
并制定计划...一起。

16:30.906 --> 16:31.990
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

16:33.325 --> 16:34.493
Uh-huh,
uh-huh...
嗯嗯，
呃呃...

16:37.329 --> 16:39.331
Uh, SpongeBuck,
why do you keep saying...
呃，海绵巴克，
你为什么一直说...

16:40.874 --> 16:42.751
Um...
嗯...

16:42.835 --> 16:44.878
You don't have
a plan, do you?
你没有
一个计划，你愿意吗？

16:44.962 --> 16:46.797
To be honest, I didn't
think I'd get this far.
说实话，我没有
我想我会走到这一步。

16:48.757 --> 16:50.467
But I know we can beat 'em
但我知道我们可以打败他们

16:50.551 --> 16:53.512
if we just work together.
如果我们一起努力的话。

16:53.595 --> 16:57.099
Dead Eye: Oh,
I am terrified  .
死眼：哦，
我很害怕。

16:57.182 --> 16:59.017
All: Dead Eye Plankton?
全部：死眼浮游生物？

16:59.101 --> 17:03.689
So fry cook, you're back...
And all alone.
所以炒菜，你回来了……
而且都是孤身一人。

17:03.772 --> 17:05.649
SpongeBuck: You wish,
Dead Eye.
海绵宝宝：如你所愿，
死眼。

17:05.733 --> 17:08.944
We are united, right... Hey!
我们是团结的，对吧……嘿！

17:09.028 --> 17:11.155
Krabs  : We're
right behind you, boy.
蟹蟹：我们是
就在你身后，男孩。

17:11.238 --> 17:12.781
Way, way, behind you.
一路，一路，在你身后。

17:12.865 --> 17:14.867
Dead Eye: So it's come to this?
死眼：所以就到了这个地步了？

17:14.950 --> 17:17.453
Mano e mano.
马诺和马诺。

17:17.536 --> 17:21.373
Well, you can hold
the mano because it's come
down to you and me.
嗯，你可以持有
马诺，因为它来了
取决于你和我。

17:21.457 --> 17:23.500
Well, well, well...
好啦好啦……

17:23.584 --> 17:25.627
Look at the time:
看看时间：

17:25.711 --> 17:27.212
High noon.
正午时分。

17:59.411 --> 18:01.580
Dead Eye: Ow!
死眼：噢！

18:01.663 --> 18:02.539
Huh?
啊？

18:11.089 --> 18:13.258
I hate all of you.
我讨厌你们所有人。

18:13.342 --> 18:14.384
Can I try?
我可以尝试吗？

18:14.468 --> 18:17.221
You can't do this... Ow!
你不能这样做……噢！

18:17.304 --> 18:19.431
Three yee-haw's
for SpongeBuck.
三唷唷
对于海绵巴克来说。

18:19.515 --> 18:22.851
Yee-haw, yee-haw, yee-haw!
呀呀呀呀呀呀呀呀呀！

18:22.935 --> 18:25.229
Krabs: Step right up, everyone.
螃蟹：大家请站起来。

18:25.312 --> 18:28.440
Just a dollar to stomp on
old Dead Eye Plankton.
只要一美元就可以踩
老死眼浮游生物。

18:28.524 --> 18:30.943
Dead Eye: Ah, ouch, ooh!
死眼：啊啊啊啊啊！

18:31.026 --> 18:33.445
Take that, you
no-good little varmint.
拿那个，你
没用的小坏蛋。

18:33.529 --> 18:35.114
I have a lot of money.
我有很多钱。

18:35.197 --> 18:36.824
Ah!
啊!

18:36.907 --> 18:40.452
Well, sheriff, you beat Dead Eye
Plankton and saved the town.
好吧，警长，你打败了死眼
浮游生物拯救了小镇。

18:44.957 --> 18:46.792
You forgot the most
important part.
你忘记的最多
重要的一部分。

18:46.875 --> 18:48.126
What's that?
那是什么？

18:48.210 --> 18:51.046
I discovered the power
of idiot friendship.
我发现了力量
白痴友谊。

18:51.129 --> 18:52.923
Both: Duh...
两人：呃……

18:53.006 --> 18:54.091
Come with me.
跟我来吧。

18:54.174 --> 18:55.968
I wanna show you something.
我想给你看一些东西。

18:56.051 --> 18:59.388
Krabs: Thank you sheriff
SpongeBuck for saving our town.
螃蟹：谢谢警长
海绵巴克拯救了我们的小镇。

